{"id":"effet","lemma":"effet","pos":"noun","rank":490,"glosses":["effect","spin, bend, curl"],"ipa":"/ɛ.fɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/Fr-effet.ogg/Fr-effet.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"effets"},"formAudio":{"effets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-effets.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je l'ai vu, en effet.","en":"I did see it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Je veux en effet aller avec toi.","en":"I do want to go with you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"to go"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Les effets sont réversibles.","en":"The effects are reversible.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Quel effet cela aura-t-il ?","en":"What effect will that have?","words":[{"g":"which"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"he / it"}]},{"text":"Cela n'aura pas d'effet.","en":"That won't have an effect.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}